      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "CHAPITRE 1 : INTRODUCTION",
      "pageStart": 13,
      "pageEnd": 16,
      "target": "../sections/sec-004-chapitre-1-introduction.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "01\nINTRODUCTION\nCe guide d'investissement pour la mise en œuvre numérique (DIIG) vise à aider les \ngouvernements et les partenaires techniques à planifier une mise en œuvre de la santé \nnumérique qui se concentre sur un ou plusieurs programmes de santé pour atteindre \nles objectifs du système de santé national. \n \nLe guide est conçu pour aider les utilisateurs du document, étape par étape, dans la \nplanification, le chiffrage et la mise en œuvre d'interventions de santé numérique \nau sein d'une initiative de santé numérique. Il vise à sélectionner des interventions \nde santé numérique qui corr",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Opens the introduction to the French edition of the Digital Implementation Investment Guide (DIIG), which helps governments and technical partners plan, cost and implement digital health interventions that serve national health system goals. Distinguishes siloed, time-limited project systems from exchange-based architectures that connect standards-based applications through health information exchange, and states that the guide focuses on modular, exchange-based implementations. Presents the guide as a companion to the WHO guideline on digital interventions for health system strengthening, building on an earlier WHO–PATH information systems toolkit and drawing on the WHO–ITU national eHealth strategy toolkit and the WHO classification of digital health interventions. Ends by listing the Principles for Digital Development, such as understanding the ecosystem, designing for scale and sustainability, being data-driven, using open standards, addressing privacy and security, and collaborating.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "not-disclosed"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-12"
      }
