        "text": "Explains how to document the structure and workflows of the health system at every level, illustrated by an example organigram linking immunization and family planning staff, facilities and reporting forms from national to community level. Recommends creating personas for managers, health workers and clients that record their responsibilities, dependencies, difficulties and view of success, adding access barriers for clients. Gives sample personas for a child vaccination programme and ends with a checklist of what should now be understood.",
