      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes the three steps for mapping how a health programme currently works: choosing the processes to target, mapping the user journey in each as a workflow, and identifying bottlenecks. A diagram shows the three focus areas of the CRDM approach, business process analysis, business process redesign and requirements definition, with the guiding question and tasks for each.",
