      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Defines functional requirements as simple statements of what a digital health application must do to help overcome the health system challenges identified earlier, and advises brainstorming scenarios along the process workflow for every end user. Describes the planning team, end users and beneficiaries, gives a sample table of user stories for a community nurse in a pregnancy-care intervention, and suggests ranking functions as essential or optional.",
