        "text": "Notes that many digital health applications have had limited uptake because they were piloted where electricity and mobile networks were inadequate, and suggests mitigations such as offline data collection with manual transfer and battery or solar chargers. Lists questions to ask early in planning about electricity, connectivity, devices, and digital literacy and language, and points to a BID Initiative resource on equipment support.",
