        "text": "Offers a persona worksheet for picturing potential end users of a digital health implementation, prompting for demographics, roles, context such as device ownership, connectivity and distance to care, and everyday difficulties. It also asks what success and motivation look like from the persona's point of view and points to a UNICEF workbook for more examples.",
