      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Continues the previous worksheet by helping teams map observed bottlenecks to classified health system challenges, grouped by the aspect of universal health coverage affected: effective coverage and quality, continuous coverage, and contact coverage. Illustrative obstacles, such as absent or unmotivated health workers, poor adherence to guidelines or treatment, loss to follow-up, distance and stigma, are each linked to a numbered challenge.",
